intro: >-
  I wanted a design system I could rely on the way real product teams do:
  opinionated, clean, and flexible enough to carry across side projects without
  re-deciding the basics every time. ESPER became my default starting point, a
  set of building blocks I can drop into any concept so I can get straight to
  the actual problem.
